### Payment Module — REST Client API Tests

```http
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ0b2tlbl90eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzkxODkzMjU4LCJpYXQiOjE3OTE4NjQ0NTgsImp0aSI6ImRlYjlhNWY0Yjg0OTQ0ZWVhYmEyZTlmZmUyMWViMWIzIiwidXNlcl9pZCI6MiwiaXNfc3VwZXJhZG1pbiI6ZmFsc2UsImlzX2hyX2FkbWluIjp0cnVlLCJpc19lbXBsb3llZSI6ZmFsc2UsImlzX2hyIjpmYWxzZX0.z4lxLMhh8Bxy1sJJ0oG811GbaOLoVhnHCQ8JsKjLHsU
@paymentId = 1
@customerId = 1
@invoiceId = 1

### 1. Create a Completed Bank Transfer Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {{customerId}},
  "invoice": {{invoiceId}},
  "payment_date": "2026-10-12",
  "payment_type": "full_payment",
  "payment_method": "bank_transfer",
  "amount_received": "400.00",
  "reference_number": "BANK-REF-001",
  "notes": "Customer payment by bank transfer",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 2. Create a Pending Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {{customerId}},
  "invoice": {{invoiceId}},
  "payment_date": "2026-10-12",
  "payment_type": "partial_payment",
  "payment_method": "bank_transfer",
  "amount_received": "200.00",
  "reference_number": "BANK-REF-002",
  "notes": "Payment awaiting confirmation",
  "status": "pending"
}

### 3. Create a Completed Online Payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {{customerId}},
  "invoice": {{invoiceId}},
  "payment_date": "2026-10-12",
  "payment_type": "partial_payment",
  "payment_method": "online_payment",
  "amount_received": "150.00",
  "reference_number": "ONLINE-REF-001",
  "notes": "Online customer payment",
  "status": "completed"
}

### 4. List Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Retrieve a Payment
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/{{paymentId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Update a Pending Payment (PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/{{paymentId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": {{customerId}},
  "invoice": {{invoiceId}},
  "payment_date": "2026-10-12",
  "payment_type": "partial_payment",
  "payment_method": "bank_transfer",
  "amount_received": "250.00",
  "reference_number": "BANK-REF-003",
  "notes": "Updated payment details",
  "status": "pending"
}

### 7. Mark a Pending Payment as Completed (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/{{paymentId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### 8. Update Payment Notes (PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/{{paymentId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Payment verified by finance team"
}

### 9. Update Payment Amount (PATCH)
### Only use for payments that have not already been posted.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/{{paymentId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount_received": "350.00"
}

### 10. Filter Payments by Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/?status=completed
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Filter Payments by Customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/?customer={{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Filter Payments by Invoice
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/?invoice={{invoiceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Search Payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/?search=BANK-REF-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Order Payments by Payment Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/?ordering=-payment_date
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Payment KPI Metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/kpi/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Payment KPI Metrics for a Customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/kpi/?customer={{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Export Payments as CSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/export/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Delete a Pending or Cancelled Payment
### Completed payments are rejected by the current view.
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/{{paymentId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Cancel a Pending Payment
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/payments/{{paymentId}}/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "cancelled"
}
```
